        "original_id": "831243ed-9074-5d44-b2e6-263dfd251d19",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Edward L. Cahn, Khady Sylla\n- Roles: film director, writer\n- Places: Dakar\n- Topics: American film, Senegalese literature, film\n\nFacts:\n- Edward L. Cahn was born on February 12, 1899, and he was an American film director.\n- Khady Sylla was born in Dakar on March 27, 1963, and she was a Senegalese writer of two novels, short work, and film.\n- Edward L. Cahn died on August 25, 1963.\n- Khady Sylla died in Dakar on October 8, 2013.",
